 "source": "Watson, Lomas & Buswell (2021) How will heat pumps alter national half-hourly heat demands? Empirical modelling based on GB field trials. Energy and Buildings 238, 110777, doi:10.1016/j.enbuild.2021.110777; supplementary workbook doi:10.6084/m9.figshare.13547447 (RHPP heat-pump trial 2012-2015, 592 heat pumps; EDRP gas-boiler trial 2009-2010, 6,600 homes).",
